{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23607","headline":"九日寄微之 · 白居易","name":"九日寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼闇头风事事妨，遶篱新菊爲谁黄。\n闲游日久心慵倦，痛饮年深肺损伤。\n吴郡两回逢九月，越州四度见重阳。\n怕飞杯酒多分数，厌听笙歌旧曲章。\n蟋蟀声寒初过雨，茱萸色浅未经霜。\n去秋共数登高会，又被今年减一场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}